nd $\\phi^3\\mathcal E_0(\\phi)$. All fields and variations have compact support, so the displayed integrations by parts have no boundary term. Retain terms through formal order $\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{op}}^{-2}$, with $O(\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{op}}^{-4})$ denoting terms at least quadratic in the formal bookkeeping parameter $\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{op}}^{-2}$, not a numerical error bound. Then $\\phi^2\\partial_\\mu\\phi\\,\\partial^\\mu\\phi$ represents $-\\frac{m^2}{3}\\phi^4$ in this quotient, and the local field substitution $\\phi_{\\mathrm{old}}=\\phi+\\frac{C}{3\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{op}}^2}\\phi^3$ changes $S_0+S_6$ to $S_0-\\frac{Cm^2}{3\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{op}}^2}\\int_M\\phi^4\\,d^4x+O(\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{op}}^{-4})$. This is an action-level statement at the retained order only.",
