          "fact": "F2",
          "source": "def-associated-bundle-to-a-principal-bundle-and-representation",
          "source_section": "Definition",
          "quote": "Let $\\pi:P\\to M$ be a smooth right principal $H$-bundle, meaning that the\ntopological principal charts of\n[[def-principal-g-bundle-and-associated-fiber-bundle]] are diffeomorphisms, and\nlet $\\rho:H\\to GL(V)$ be a smooth finite-dimensional real representation.\nDefine a right action on $P\\times V$ by",
          "uses": [
            "1.1",
            "3.1",
            "4.1"
