research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-2026-10-23/research-eft-experiments.md-93-For SMEFT, define the Standard Model gauge group and every representation, the linearly transforming Higgs doublet, the exact global/flavor/baryon/lepton assumptions, and a finite operator order. For HEFT/electroweak chiral EFT, define the nonlinear Goldstone coordinate/map for the chosen coset, the physical scalar singlet, its transformation law, and the chiral/loop power counting. State a concrete parameterization and coordinate patch for Goldstone fields when needed; do not identify it with an ordinary linear Higgs doublet by notation alone.
