+---
+id: pthm-aqft-smeft-as-restricted-heft-branch
+kind: physics-theorem
+title: The selected SMEFT model is a restricted HEFT branch
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 7
