+---
+id: def-aqft-warsaw-basis-contract
+kind: definition
+title: Finite dimension-six Warsaw coefficient contract
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 5
+domain: physics
+library: physics
